{"ID":"20240205153907-a84pqpr","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153907-a84pqpr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153907-a84pqpr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092156-y423b9j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607132544-axi4g56\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617084806-h0wu6l7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:7\u0026#125;","title":"086升麻","type":"doc","updated":"20240913160101"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206092156-y423b9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092156-y423b9j","updated":"20240206092208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产东北地区。\n【性状】\t呈不规则的长形块状，多分枝，呈结节状，长1020cm，直径24cm。表面黑褐色或棕褐色，粗糙不平，有坚硬的细须根残留，上面有数个圆形空洞的茎基痕，洞内壁显放射状网纹；下面凹凸不平，具须根痕。体轻，质坚硬，不易折断，断面不平坦，有裂隙，纤维性，黄绿色或淡黄白色。气微，味微苦而涩。\n【性味】\t辛、微辛，微寒。\n【功效】\t发表透疹，清热解毒，升举阳气。用于风热头痛，齿痛，口疮，咽喉肿痛，麻疹不透，阳毒发斑；脱肛，子宫脱垂。\n【注解】\t“鬼脸升麻”：升麻呈不规则结节块状，表面黑褐色，有数个圆洞的茎痕，外皮脱落处露出网状筋脉，形状特殊而且丑陋，故称为“鬼脸升麻”。\n“火燎升麻”：指升麻药材在加工过程中用火燎去须根，从而使升麻表面发黑色，可见到火烧过的须根痕。"}]},{"ID":"20240206092157-tpw12ux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092157-tpw12ux","updated":"20240206092157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206092157-8f1d2iu.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155155-60w6pgc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155155-60w6pgc","updated":"20240205155155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"升麻"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/升麻-20240205155155-rzqgbo5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240808132054-mywsl5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240808132054-mywsl5u","updated":"20240808132810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 414px;","style":"width: 404px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"升麻 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/升麻 7-20240808132028-1c3rk6l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 404px;\" parent-style=\"width: 414px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 441px;","style":"width: 431px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"升麻 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/升麻 9-20240808132810-x2ki1wt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 431px;\" parent-style=\"width: 441px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240808132714-gk1ueta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240808132714-gk1ueta","updated":"20240808133533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 388px;","style":"width: 378px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240808132250-n4n7aji.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 378px;\" parent-style=\"width: 388px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 797px;","style":"width: 787px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"升麻 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/升麻 13-20240808133533-e5erkay.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 787px;\" parent-style=\"width: 797px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240808132940-4wa4bx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240808132940-4wa4bx1","updated":"20240808133335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 399px;","style":"width: 389px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"升麻 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/升麻 8-20240808132600-bis2vz8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 389px;\" parent-style=\"width: 399px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 399px;","style":"width: 389px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"升麻 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/升麻 11-20240808133225-gidtpx9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 389px;\" parent-style=\"width: 399px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 399px;","style":"width: 389px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"升麻 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/升麻 12-20240808133335-mqnzapk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 389px;\" parent-style=\"width: 399px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240808130756-zmvlq69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240808130756-zmvlq69","updated":"20240808141138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 674px;","style":"width: 664px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"升麻 (18)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/升麻 18-20240808141138-q8w4sjy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 664px;\" parent-style=\"width: 674px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 276px;","style":"width: 266px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"升麻"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/升麻-20240808130756-nojm9ka.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 266px;\" parent-style=\"width: 276px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 237px;","style":"width: 227px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"升麻 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/升麻 1-20240808130853-wt37y6g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 227px;\" parent-style=\"width: 237px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240808130955-2c9zll0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240808130955-2c9zll0","updated":"20240808131151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 358px;","style":"width: 348px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOp